---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-87-education-learning-skills-knowledge-cultural-capability-registry.json";

const school = registry.early_childhood_school_access_inclusion_learning_dossiers;
const postsecondary = registry.postsecondary_vocational_apprenticeship_affordability_ledgers;
const capability = registry.learning_capability_credential_skills_transition_registers;
const knowledge = registry.public_knowledge_culture_research_community_learning_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Education, Learning, Knowledge And Culture | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive education-access, postsecondary, learning-capability, public-knowledge, and cultural-capability records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-education-knowledge-culture-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Education And Culture</div><h1 class="page-title">Enrollment is not learning, and a credential is not demonstrated capability.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 87 traces whether people can participate in inclusive education, learn and apply durable capabilities, afford postsecondary and vocational pathways, reach decent work and civic life, and use public knowledge and cultural institutions through disruption and recovery.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive school dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive postsecondary ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive capability registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive knowledge ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 education decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Early Childhood, Schools, Access And Inclusion</div><h2>Eight school-access dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/school-attendance-access-learning-inclusion-001/">Read the school-access guide</a></div><div class="grid">{school.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.school_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/education-knowledge-culture/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Early childhood, enrollment, attendance, inclusion, disability and language access, Indigenous jurisdiction, learner supports, educators, facilities, teaching, assessment, learning, rights, continuity, review, and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Postsecondary, Vocational And Apprenticeship Pathways</div><h2>Eight pathway ledgers contain no affordability or completion finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/vocational-apprenticeship-skills-recognition-001/">Read the vocational-pathway guide</a></div><div class="grid">{postsecondary.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.postsecondary_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/education-knowledge-culture/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.postsecondary_vocational_apprenticeship_affordability_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Admissions, accreditation, affordability, grants, debt, learner support, faculty and instructors, facilities, placements, apprenticeship hours, completion, credentials, job pathways, quality, continuity, teach-out, and review remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Learning, Credentials, Skills And Transition</div><h2>Eight capability registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/learning-assessment-credential-capability-001/">Read the capability guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{capability.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/education-knowledge-culture/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.learning_capability_credential_skills_transition_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Curriculum, practice, assessment validity, foundational and applied capability, credentials, prior learning, portability, demonstrated application, decent-work and civic transition, equity, privacy, second chances, longitudinal evidence, correction, and remedy remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.capability_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Public Knowledge, Research, Arts And Culture</div><h2>Eight knowledge ledgers contain no recovery finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/research-public-knowledge-translation-001/">Read the public-knowledge guide</a></div><div class="grid">{knowledge.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/education-knowledge-culture/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.public_knowledge_culture_research_community_learning_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Libraries, archives, research, journalism, public access, digital preservation, information literacy, Indigenous knowledge, integrity, translation, local media, arts, culture, worker conditions, freedom, continuity, reopening, recovery, trust, and audit remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.knowledge_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty education and cultural-capability state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without enrolling or admitting anyone; awarding a credential; issuing learning, capability, transition, public-knowledge, information-literacy, cultural or recovery findings; or creating a receipt, score, rank, or stage change.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/education-learning-skills-knowledge-cultural-capability.json">Education and cultural-capability JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
